    {
      "id": "application.copy.054883012e1decf9377be805",
      "source": "Check retained translations for every enabled language. Preparation fills missing entries through the existing Azure allowance and saves them for everyone. Approved-only copy still requires approval.",
      "context": "visual interface copy",
      "sourceRevision": "02c19023b3e6610b",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translationPolicy": "AzureAllowed",
      "reuseScope": "Global",
      "languageCode": "ht",
      "text": "Verifye tradiksyon ki konsève yo pou chak lang ki aktive. Preparasyon an ranpli antre ki manke yo avèk kantite tradiksyon Azure ki deja disponib la epi li anrejistre yo pou tout moun. Tèks ki bezwen apwobasyon toujou dwe jwenn apwobasyon."
    },
    {
      "id": "application.copy.054883012e1decf9377be805",
      "source": "Check retained translations for every enabled language. Preparation fills missing entries through the existing Azure allowance and saves them for everyone. Approved-only copy still requires approval.",
      "context": "visual interface copy",
      "sourceRevision": "02c19023b3e6610b",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translationPolicy": "AzureAllowed",
      "reuseScope": "Global",
      "languageCode": "es",
      "text": "Comprueba las traducciones conservadas de cada idioma habilitado. La preparación completa las entradas que faltan usando la cuota de Azure existente y las guarda para todos. Los textos sujetos a aprobación siguen requiriéndola."
    },
    {
      "id": "application.copy.054883012e1decf9377be805",
      "source": "Check retained translations for every enabled language. Preparation fills missing entries through the existing Azure allowance and saves them for everyone. Approved-only copy still requires approval.",
