    {
      "id": "application.copy.404636fcd1e960d4ce20b3b7",
      "source": "Inspect missing public copy without using translation capacity. Import a reviewed artifact of up to 250 entries. Generated copy remains machine-authored; approval-only copy requires its existing review.",
      "context": "visual interface copy",
      "sourceRevision": "ffbcaa03c3b14c23",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translationPolicy": "AzureAllowed",
      "reuseScope": "Global",
      "languageCode": "ht",
      "text": "Egzamine tèks piblik ki manke yo san itilize kapasite tradiksyon. Enpòte yon fichye ki deja revize epi ki gen jiska 250 antre. Tèks ki jenere yo toujou make kòm tèks machin ekri; tèks ki bezwen apwobasyon dwe toujou pase nan revizyon ki deja obligatwa a."
    },
    {
      "id": "application.copy.404636fcd1e960d4ce20b3b7",
      "source": "Inspect missing public copy without using translation capacity. Import a reviewed artifact of up to 250 entries. Generated copy remains machine-authored; approval-only copy requires its existing review.",
      "context": "visual interface copy",
      "sourceRevision": "ffbcaa03c3b14c23",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translationPolicy": "AzureAllowed",
      "reuseScope": "Global",
      "languageCode": "es",
      "text": "Inspecciona los textos públicos que faltan sin consumir capacidad de traducción. Importa un archivo revisado de hasta 250 entradas. Los textos generados siguen identificados como contenido creado por una máquina; los textos sujetos a aprobación requieren la revisión ya establecida."
    },
    {
      "id": "application.copy.404636fcd1e960d4ce20b3b7",
      "source": "Inspect missing public copy without using translation capacity. Import a reviewed artifact of up to 250 entries. Generated copy remains machine-authored; approval-only copy requires its existing review.",
      "context": "visual interface copy",
      "sourceRevision": "ffbcaa03c3b14c23",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translationPolicy": "AzureAllowed",
      "reuseScope": "Global",
      "languageCode": "fr",
      "text": "Examinez les textes publics manquants sans utiliser de capacité de traduction. Importez un fichier révisé contenant jusqu’à 250 entrées. Les textes générés restent identifiés comme rédigés par une machine ; les textes soumis à approbation nécessitent la révision déjà prévue."
    },
